{"sourceUrl":"https://env.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0703/c9571a746160/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:40.731356+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://env.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0703/c9571a746160/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span>一、申请资格</span></p><p><span>本科期间学习成绩优秀，有意向攻读硕士和博士学位、乐于为我国科研事业作出贡献的大三优秀本科生。</span></p><p><span>二、规模及对象</span></p><p><span>300</span><span>名左右，物理、化学、光学、材料科学、环境科学、核科学与技术、计算机技术、精密仪器与机械、控制科学与工程、电气工程、软件工程、生物等相关院系专业排名靠前的大三优秀本科生。 </span></p><p><span>三、提交材料</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>、前两年半成绩单（有学校教务部门或所在院系公章）与总成绩排名证明（有学校教务部门或所在院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、能体现自身能力的获奖证书复印件、英语水平证明、学术论文等。</span></p><p><span>四、申请方式</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>、网址：</span><span>http://xspt.ustc.edu.cn/logon</span><span>，推免生预报名</span><span><span>-</span></span><span>环境科学与光电技术学院。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、网上申报截止日期</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日（第一批已报名，但因个人原因未能参加的同学，需要在第二批重新系统报名申请）。</span></p><p><span>五、联系方式</span></p><p><span><span>联系人：</span><span><span>徐</span></span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span>电话：</span><span><span><span>0551-6559</span><span><span>1522</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>Email</span><span>：</span><span><span>dwxu@aiofm.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>特别提醒：由于受到活动场地等因素的限制，本次没有审核到的营员自动转为第</span><span><span>二</span></span><span>批待审核营员，第</span><span><span>二</span></span><span>批开营时间拟定于</span></span><span>8</span><span>月中下旬。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><a href=\"https://env.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0703/c9571a746160/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>环境科学与光电技术学院</span></span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"d68d33fccb6a830ae6a9612d0c90d979da66e516e5345f88e496dfc625e164f6","textLength":481,"sourceSha256":"c8bd4a9877f5a39cb9f10ae63603ef060d2e1714ac8f6b1b8ab405b314425d1f","selecto